This library contains code adapted from libwebrtc under another licence:

dev/glassworks/hawebrtc/TextureFrameDrawer.kt reproduces the steps of
- VideoFrameDrawer (drawFrame, calculateTransformedRenderSize, drawTexture), and
- RendererCommon.convertMatrixFromAndroidGraphicsMatrix,
from libwebrtc M150 (https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src, branch-heads/7871,
sdk/android/api/org/webrtc), as built by webrtc-sdk/android 150.7871.04.
