(https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/refs/heads/main/PATENTS).

Changes: rewritten in Kotlin to draw a texture frame into matrices and arrays kept across frames,
instead of allocating new ones for every frame. Those steps stay under BSD-3-Clause.

The library also depends on libwebrtc itself (io.github.webrtc-sdk:android-prefixed), which an app
pulls in as a separate dependency under its own licences.
